Usage: pqc-scan probe tls [OPTIONS] --port <PORT> <HOST>

Arguments:
  <HOST>  

Options:
      --port <PORT>                
      --allow-cidr <ALLOW_CIDR>    
      --out-dir <OUT_DIR>          
      --lang <LANG>                [default: en] [possible values: en, ja]
      --server-name <SERVER_NAME>  
      --ca-file <CA_FILE>          
  -h, --help                       Print help
